# The intro screen's music for 65 seconds (tools/check_audio.py): the one intro
# track of the stock Settings.txt is 48 s long, so it must start again, without
# a gap or a click (docs/spec/06 §5.5: each track loops). The device mixes as
# Windows' usually does (WASAPI's shared mode: 32-bit float at 48 kHz), so the
# 22.05 kHz track and the 44.1 kHz sounds are converted.
# device: F32 2 48000
options --open=intro --layout=1024x768 --size=1280x800 --audio
timeout 7200
wait-screen front
wait 3900
